# Funnel-only scope

- Only modify code under `funnel/`.
- Do not add or edit Streamlit dashboard (`src/`), data API, migrations, report_tools, or production DB schema/import scripts in this repo.
- Shared `product_flow.db` (via `SO_PROD_DB` / `prod_db.py`) is **read-only**. Persist funnel state only in `funnel/data/funnel.db`.
- Deploy with `funnel/deploy_funnel.sh` only.
